<title>NETHERLANDS: Akzo completes U.S. salt sale to Cargill.</title>
<headline>Akzo completes U.S. salt sale to Cargill.</headline>
<dateline>ARNHEM, Netherlands 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemical group Akzo Nobel NV said on Monday it had concluded the sale of its U.S. salt activities to commodities firm Cargill.</p>
<p>&quot;Akzo Nobel has completed the sale of the North American production, processing and marketing assets of Akzo Nobel Salt to Cargill Incorporated,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Akzo said on Friday that the sale was expected to be concluded in the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>No financial details were given.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
